---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import RelatedLinks from '../components/RelatedLinks.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cloud vs Local"
  description="Use AliasMode Cloud to synchronize browser profiles and collaborate with your team, or choose account-free Local mode on one computer."
>
  <p class="eyebrow">Choose how you work</p>
  <h1>Sync with Cloud, or keep it Local.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Most people start with a free Cloud account for portable profiles and team access. Local mode is ready when you prefer to work without an account.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/download/">Download &amp; sign up free</a><a class="button secondary" href="#local">See Local mode</a></div>
  <div class="grid mode-grid">
    <section class="card cloud-card"><p class="mode-label">Recommended</p><h2>AliasMode Cloud</h2><ul><li>Uses a verified email and password.</li><li>Gives each account one workspace with owner and member roles.</li><li>Syncs encrypted portable profiles and keeps a local cache.</li><li>Lets you revoke devices and use trash for deleted profiles.</li></ul><a class="mode-link" href="/cloud/">Explore Cloud →</a></section>
    <section class="card" id="local"><p class="mode-label">Account-free</p><h2>AliasMode Local</h2><ul><li>Requires no AliasMode account.</li><li>Sends no traffic to AliasMode Cloud.</li><li>Keeps profile data on that computer.</li><li>Uses app analytics only when you explicitly opt in.</li></ul><a class="mode-link" href="/local/">Explore Local →</a></section>
  </div>
  <section class="sync-section"><p class="eyebrow">Built for real work</p><h2>Keep profile changes moving.</h2><p>Cloud warns when the same profile opens at the same time, rejects stale uploads, and retries pending uploads. When you move a Local profile to Cloud, AliasMode asks for clear confirmation before upload.</p></section>
  <RelatedLinks paths={['/local/', '/cloud/', '/pricing/']} title="Choose your AliasMode setup" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .mode-grid { gap: .8rem; grid-template-columns: 1.08fr .92fr; margin-top: 3.5rem; }
  .mode-grid .card { padding: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); }
  .cloud-card { background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--night), #241d47); border-color: transparent; color: #fff; }
  .cloud-card li { color: var(--night-ink); }
  .mode-label { color: var(--violet); font: 700 .66rem/1.2 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cloud-card .mode-label { color: #b7a1ff; }
  .mode-link { color: var(--violet-deep); display: inline-block; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .cloud-card .mode-link { color: #b7a1ff; }
  .sync-section { background: var(--violet-soft); border-left: .35rem solid var(--violet); border-radius: 0 var(--r-lg) var(--r-lg) 0; margin-top: 4rem; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .sync-section h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 2.9rem); }
  @media (max-width: 44rem) { .mode-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
